\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 A short setup leads you one way.\u8232 The final part changes how you understand the whole thing.\

\f0\b Example:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I just got fired from the keyboard factory. They said I wasn\'92t putting in enough shifts.\'94\
